{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07494","headline":"颍川留别司仓李万 · 刘长卿","name":"颍川留别司仓李万","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人早负干将器，谁言未展平生意。\n想君畴昔高步时，肯料如今折腰事。\n且知投刃皆若虚，日挥案牍常有余。\n槐暗公庭趋小吏，荷香陂水脍鲈鱼。\n客里相逢款话深，如何岐路剩沾襟。\n白云西上催归念，颍水东流是别心。\n落日征骖随去尘，含情挥手背城闉。\n已恨良时空此别，不堪秋草更愁人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}